Synchronoss Unified Toolbox – User Guide
========================================

See the full guide:

  User Guide v2.2.0.txt

Quick start (Windows):

  1. pip install -r requirements.txt
  2. Double-click Run_Toolbox_GUI.bat
  3. Select Selection.zip, Case folder, GPG password, optional Owner name
  4. Click Run
  5. Open parsed_output/index.html when finished

GPG4Win is required for decryption. If it is not installed, the program will
offer to help install it (via winget) when you click Run. You can also install
it from https://www.gpg4win.org.

Use the original (or copied) selection.zip from Synchronoss — not unzipped files.
